    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's been getting to you. The hectic, non-stop rush of city life. The endless, amoebic crowds of people surrounding you at every turn and yet somehow making you feel like you're all alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Pedro Bertasso, an urbanite who has just bought an old farm in the countryside, you decide that if you're going to be alone, it's best you're alone with the peace and quiet of nature and honest, hard work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, things didn't go exactly according to plan for Pedro. Some... thing soon disrupts his desired solitude and tranquility.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Farm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/fc504d68f3b74fd7ddc23946c5361912.poster.avif?t=1748054822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/fc504d68f3b74fd7ddc23946c5361912.webm?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/fc504d68f3b74fd7ddc23946c5361912.mp4?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a selection of various seeds, cultivate a number of crops on your farm. Your modest venture grows together with the fields you tend to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put in the work to earn a living and then expand \u2013 restore your new home, diversify into livestock, invest in upgrades that make harvests an easier time for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Face the Haunting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/e9279b9a6c5de37fc5e657411cd7c8be.poster.avif?t=1748054822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/e9279b9a6c5de37fc5e657411cd7c8be.webm?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/e9279b9a6c5de37fc5e657411cd7c8be.mp4?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll welcome the easier times because they're few and far between. Something is really wrong with the farm and even if the previous owners hadn't hidden this fact from Pedro, they sure wouldn't have been able to explain it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come nightfall, strange noises echo from the impenetrable darkness, and it gets worse with each passing day. Their sources soon manifest and get violent. Assemble an arsenal of weapons and fight for your very survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Optimize Your Work</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/62bbd0d2fc33b025ec5c5839097be6bb.poster.avif?t=1748054822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/62bbd0d2fc33b025ec5c5839097be6bb.webm?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/62bbd0d2fc33b025ec5c5839097be6bb.mp4?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell \u200b\u200byour crops at the market and buy new tools and vehicles to optimize your work in the field. Work consistently, balance between your farming efforts and your defenses and soon you'll swap your sickle out for a genuine combine harvester.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Tale of Rural Terror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/732669cea98ddb3094275ed25c48697b.poster.avif?t=1748054822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/732669cea98ddb3094275ed25c48697b.webm?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/732669cea98ddb3094275ed25c48697b.mp4?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But this can't go on and running away is just not an option under these conditions. The creatures infesting this land will soon be the end of Pedro if he doesn't figure out what exactly is going on. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Isolated from the rest of the world in a vast open field, you sense there must be something particular amidst the void and carnage, something unholy that's the source of it all...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the Open Field</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/a3c459772801076ad40f36e24d0652e8.poster.avif?t=1748054822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/a3c459772801076ad40f36e24d0652e8.webm?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/a3c459772801076ad40f36e24d0652e8.mp4?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must investigate every nook and cranny of the surrounding area if you're to make it. Pedro is bound to be rewarded for his efforts, not just with knowledge but also valuable items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover more about the farm's macabre past and gather resources by exploring the open countryside.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unlock New Areas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/ffa6a0a7a1b52b901d359aef80a289df.poster.avif?t=1748054822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/ffa6a0a7a1b52b901d359aef80a289df.webm?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/ffa6a0a7a1b52b901d359aef80a289df.mp4?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy new areas to expand your farm and gain access to new items and vehicles. But be careful \u2013 whatever haunts these parts doesn't appreciate your fighting back. With new fields, you're bound to encounter new fears...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's been getting to you. The hectic, non-stop rush of city life. The endless, amoebic crowds of people surrounding you at every turn and yet somehow making you feel like you're all alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Pedro Bertasso, an urbanite who has just bought an old farm in the countryside, you decide that if you're going to be alone, it's best you're alone with the peace and quiet of nature and honest, hard work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, things didn't go exactly according to plan for Pedro. Some... thing soon disrupts his desired solitude and tranquility.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Farm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/fc504d68f3b74fd7ddc23946c5361912.poster.avif?t=1748054822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/fc504d68f3b74fd7ddc23946c5361912.webm?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/fc504d68f3b74fd7ddc23946c5361912.mp4?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a selection of various seeds, cultivate a number of crops on your farm. Your modest venture grows together with the fields you tend to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put in the work to earn a living and then expand \u2013 restore your new home, diversify into livestock, invest in upgrades that make harvests an easier time for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Face the Haunting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/e9279b9a6c5de37fc5e657411cd7c8be.poster.avif?t=174805482