loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/732669cea98ddb3094275ed25c48697b.poster.avif?t=1748054822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/732669cea98ddb3094275ed25c48697b.webm?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/732669cea98ddb3094275ed25c48697b.mp4?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But this can't go on and running away is just not an option under these conditions. The creatures infesting this land will soon be the end of Pedro if he doesn't figure out what exactly is going on. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Isolated from the rest of the world in a vast open field, you sense there must be something particular amidst the void and carnage, something unholy that's the source of it all...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the Open Field</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/a3c459772801076ad40f36e24d0652e8.poster.avif?t=1748054822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/a3c459772801076ad40f36e24d0652e8.webm?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/a3c459772801076ad40f36e24d0652e8.mp4?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must investigate every nook and cranny of the surrounding area if you're to make it. Pedro is bound to be rewarded for his efforts, not just with knowledge but also valuable items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover more about the farm's macabre past and gather resources by exploring the open countryside.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unlock New Areas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/ffa6a0a7a1b52b901d359aef80a289df.poster.avif?t=1748054822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/ffa6a0a7a1b52b901d359aef80a289df.webm?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437790/extras/ffa6a0a7a1b52b901d359aef80a289df.mp4?t=1748054822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy new areas to expand your farm and gain access to new items and vehicles. But be careful \u2013 whatever haunts these parts doesn't appreciate your fighting back. With new fields, you're bound to encounter new fears...</p>",
